An omitted lot cost is determined by the shared SEK unit basis of all available lots.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gains

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Fund  4 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase at the same unit cost
  Assets:Fund  6 FUND {{600 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -600 SEK

2024-01-03 Partial sale without a lot cost
  Assets:Fund  -3 FUND @ 120 SEK
  Assets:Cash  360 SEK
  Income:Gains  -60 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 First purchase
    Assets:Fund                         4 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -400.00 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase at the same unit cost
    Assets:Fund                         6 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -600.00 SEK

2024-01-03 Partial sale without a lot cost
    Assets:Fund                         -3 FUND {100.00 SEK} @ 120.00 SEK
    Assets:Cash                           360.00 SEK
    Income:Gains                          -60.00 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========
